  "purpose": "Machine-readable map of Appsolino maintenance automations: trigger → concurrency → write authority → downstream. Single source for operators and agents.",
  "goldenRule": {
    "upstreamExact": "easy to absorb — strong integration tests, no human, no edit agent unless concrete failure",
